<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="light">
    <title>{% block subject %}Votre rendez-vous | FullJam Dev{% endblock %}</title>
</head>
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f3f1f7; color: #292333; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">
    <div style="display: none; max-height: 0; overflow: hidden; opacity: 0; mso-hide: all;">{% block preheader %}Les informations utiles pour votre rendez-vous.{% endblock %}</div>
    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color: #f3f1f7;">
        <tr><td align="center" style="padding: 32px 12px;">
            <table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; max-width: 600px;">
                <tr><td style="padding: 24px 28px; background-color: #241b35; border-radius: 16px 16px 0 0;">
                    <p style="margin: 0; color: #ffffff; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: .5px;">FullJam Dev<span style="color: #c9afff;">.</span></p>
                    <p style="margin: 8px 0 0; color: #d4c7e7; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 2px;">UN TEMPS POUR ÉCHANGER</p>
                </td></tr>
                <tr><td style="padding: 32px 28px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0 0 16px 16px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; overflow-wrap: anywhere;">
                    <p style="margin: 0 0 12px; color: #6750a4; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase;">{% block eyebrow %}Votre rendez-vous{% endblock %}</p>
                    <h1 style="margin: 0 0 24px; color: #292333; font-size: 28px; line-height: 1.25;">{% block heading %}Faisons le point.{% endblock %}</h1>
                    {% block content %}{% endblock %}
                </td></tr>
                <tr><td style="padding: 24px 20px; text-align: center; color: #6c6478; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6;">
                    <p style="margin: 0;">Une question ? Vous pouvez répondre directement à cet email.</p>
                    <p style="margin: 8px 0 0;">FullJam Dev · Développement web</p>
                </td></tr>
            </table>
        </td></tr>
    </table>
</body>
</html>
